[00:50.02][02:31.17]And we can see (How the colors bleed)
[00:51.97][02:33.06]How it could be (We can make believe)
[00:53.72][02:34.98]My calloused fingers pick and place the pieces
[00:57.04][02:38.21]Once beneath my feet 
