[03:23.95]Daydream
[03:25.13]I’ll weave it in a wreath
[03:27.05]The clouds, the sky and every sprout and seed 
[03:31.69]In colors of acrylic
[03:33.55]To mix it on my palette
[03:35.47]The gallery of life yet lived is-
[03:41.74]Left a corner of the canvas
[03:44.07]Willfully unfinished, sketches on a page
[03:48.97]So you can join in creation
